OL,3,AMillions vote early in US midterms as
OL,4,ADemocrat's shock Republican endorsement
OL,5,Arocks Michigan race
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the final day of campaigning in
OL,8,Fthe US midterms, where key elections
OL,9,Fwill determine which party controls
OL,10,FCongress for the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,11,Fpresidency - see how these elections
OL,12,Fcould reshape US politics
OL,14,FElsewhere, Democrat Haley Stevens has
OL,15,Fstunned her party after endorsing
OL,16,FRepublican candidate Mike Rogers -
OL,17,FAbdul El-Sayed's rival in the tight
OL,18,FMichigan Senate race
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
